OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1785869310
OL,3,CMan jailed for aggravated burglary
OL,4,Cwhich left victim with fractured spine
OL,6,FA man has been jailed for carrying out
OL,7,Fa violent aggravated burglary at a
OL,8,Ffamily home in Aylesbury, which left
OL,9,Fseveral people injured, including one
OL,10,Fwho suffered a fractured spine.
OL,12,FGlen Johnson, aged 49, of no fixed
OL,13,Faddress, was sentenced to 15 years'
OL,14,Fimprisonment after being convicted of
OL,15,Faggravated burglary.
OL,17,FJohnson was found guilty by a
OL,18,Funanimous jury following a five-day
OL,19,Ftrial, with the verdict returned on 6
OL,20,FMarch.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/5
