FL,388,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38702
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1785869310
OL,3,CMan jailed for aggravated burglary
OL,4,Cwhich left victim with fractured spine
OL,6,FA group of around six people broke
OL,7,Fthrough the front door and rear patio
OL,8,Fdoors at an address in Beaufort Close
OL,9,Fat around 3am on 30 April 2025.
OL,11,FThey threatened seven people inside
OL,12,Fand demanded the transfer of
OL,13,Fcryptocurrency.
OL,15,FWhen the victims, who were aged
OL,16,Fbetween 21 and 75, were unable to
OL,17,Fcomply with these demands, they were
OL,18,Fsubjected to violence.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/5
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,388,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1785869310
OL,3,CMan jailed for aggravated burglary
OL,4,Cwhich left victim with fractured spine
OL,6,FThey sustained a range of injuries,
OL,7,Fincluding bruising and swelling to
OL,8,Ftheir faces and bodies, swollen eyes,
OL,9,Fand head and neck injuries. One victim
OL,10,Fsuffered a fractured spine.
OL,12,FOfficers from Thames Valley Police
OL,13,Fchased the offenders from the scene,
OL,14,Fdetaining Johnson, and subsequently
OL,15,Fcharging him on 1 May 2025.
OL,17,FAn investigation found that tracking
OL,18,Fdevices and signal jammers had been
OL,19,Fused in the burglary, which the force
OL,20,Fsays highlights the "sophisticated
OL,21,Fnature of the criminality involved".
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/5
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,388,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1785869310
OL,3,CMan jailed for aggravated burglary
OL,4,Cwhich left victim with fractured spine
OL,6,FInvestigating officer Detective
OL,7,FConstable Chris Clarke,
OL,8,FBuckinghamshire Priority Crime Team,
OL,9,Fsaid: "This was a serious and
OL,10,Ffrightening offence that had a lasting
OL,11,Fimpact on the victims.
OL,13,F"Johnson was part of a group that
OL,14,Ftargeted a family home in the middle
OL,15,Fof the night, using violence and
OL,16,Fintimidation in an attempt to obtain
OL,17,Fcryptocurrency.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/5
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,388,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38705
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1785869310
OL,3,CMan jailed for aggravated burglary
OL,4,Cwhich left victim with fractured spine
OL,6,F"The injuries caused to the victims
OL,7,Fwere significant, both physically and
OL,8,Femotionally, and one victim suffered a
OL,9,Ffractured spine as a result of the
OL,10,Fattack.
OL,12,F"The robust 15-year sentence handed
OL,13,Fdown by the court reflects the
OL,14,Fseverity of Johnson's actions and
OL,15,Fsends a clear message that this kind
OL,16,Fof violent criminality will not be
OL,17,Ftolerated.
OL,19,F"Our thoughts remain with the victims,
OL,20,Fand we hope this outcome delivers a
OL,21,Fmeasure of justice for them."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/5
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
